flowchart TD
  HUMAN[Bound human coding prompt] --> CAP[Private scoped capture]
  CAP --> STORE[Durable task and retry journal]
  STORE --> OBS[Observe exact native process and session]
  OBS --> WAIT{Work, human wait, or native retry active?}
  WAIT -->|Yes| DRAIN[Wait for existing operation to drain]
  DRAIN --> OBS
  WAIT -->|No| FLAG{Explicit finish and current verified RED or GREEN?}
  FLAG -->|Yes| END[End this watch and clear active prompt]
  FLAG -->|No| STALL{Quiet incomplete task and cooldown elapsed?}
  TEST[Intermediate test RED or GREEN] --> OBS
  STALL -->|No| OBS
  STALL -->|Yes| BUDGET{Three retries already spent?}
  BUDGET -->|Yes| EXHAUST[End this watch as exhausted]
  BUDGET -->|No| RESERVE[Persist unique message ID and spend one retry]
  RESERVE --> RESUME[Same objective, settings, session and checkpoint]
  RESUME --> OBS
  RESERVE --> UNCERTAIN[Uncertain delivery reconciles by message ID]
  UNCERTAIN -->|Observed| OBS
  HUMAN -->|New objective| SUPER[Supersede prior watch]
  STOP[Human Stop] --> CANCEL[Cancel recovery]
  EXTERNAL[Unrecognized side-effect domain] --> HOLD[Hold without replay]
